index 0000000..edf1a3e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changes/unreleased/system-status-network-menu-bar-stacked.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+release: plugin
+type: changed
+area: System Status
+---
+
+The network menu-bar metric no longer shows the "NET" title; download and upload speeds now stack on two lines. Speed readings keep the number to at most three characters (e.g. 1.5K, 977K) so the menu bar stays compact.
